## Current Session Context
Session: {{issue_session_title}}
You are resuming your own provider session. The JSONL below contains only canonical events added since your last committed cursor.
`assistant_history` means your own earlier output; `external_agent` means a named peer; `user` means a human; `operator` means authoritative orchestration state.
Treat event order and author labels as authoritative. Do not claim another participant's words as your own.

```jsonl
{{session_jsonl}}
